  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Platform for China-Brazil Green Food Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to reduced deforestation in the Amazon and the Cerrado through increased Chinese demand for deforestation and conversion-free commodities from Brazil. Project outcomes will be reports and analysis to support ministries and agencies in Brazil and China with regard to low carbon initiatives on bilateral soy and beef trade are identified and developed, China-Brazil research platform with focus on low carbon soy and beef trade initiatives relevant to origination areas in Brazil is established, research gaps relevant to increasing low carbon soy and beef trade between Brazil and China are identified and filled, green investment in China-Brazil technology cooperation around low carbon soy and beef trade are promoted, and green value chain strategies for low-carbon bilateral agricultural trade are developed and implemented.</narrative>
  </description>
